// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            timeout-ms = <75>;
            layers = <0>;
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        exqm: exqm {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "EXQM";
            bindings = <&kp EXCL>, <&kp QMARK>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        cose: cose {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "COSE";
            bindings = <&kp COMMA>, <&kp SEMI>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        doco: doco {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "DOCO";
            bindings = <&kp DOT>, <&kp COLON>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
       &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E  &kp R  &kp T         &kp Y      &kp U  &kp I  &kp O  &kp P
       &kp A  &kp S  &kp D  &kp F  &kp G         &kp H      &kp J  &kp K  &kp L  &kp SQT
&none  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C  &kp V  &kp B         &kp N      &kp M  &cose  &doco  &exqm    &none
                     &none  &mo 1  &kp LSHIFT    &kp SPACE  &mo 2  &none
            >;
        };

        num_sym {
            bindings = <
        &kp N1      &kp N2        &kp N3    &kp N4        &kp N5       &kp N6     &kp N7     &kp N8     &kp N9     &kp N0
        &kp LS(LT)  &kp LS(LPAR)  &kp LBKT  &kp LS(LBRC)  &kp SPACE    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE
&trans  &kp LS(GT)  &kp LS(RPAR)  &kp RBKT  &kp LS(RBRC)  &kp SPACE    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &trans
                                  &trans    &trans        &trans       &trans     &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        sym {
            bindings = <
        &kp N1     &kp N2     &kp N3     &kp N4     &kp N5       &kp N6     &kp N7     &kp N8     &kp N9     &kp N0
        &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE    &kp LEFT   &kp DOWN   &kp UP     &kp RIGHT  &kp SPACE
&trans  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &trans
                              &trans     &trans     &trans       &trans     &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        device {
            bindings = <
       &none       &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &none             &none    &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1  &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_SEL 3  &bt BT_SEL 4
       &kp K_MUTE  &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN     &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &none    &none         &none         &none         &none         &none
&none  &none       &none                 &none                 &none             &none    &none         &none         &none         &none         &none         &bt BT_CLR
                                         &none                 &none             &none    &none         &none         &none
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        device {
            if-layers = <3 2>;
            then-layer = <4>;
        };
    };
};
